# The generation model at the ceiling this card holds, for the baseline arm.
#
# The evaluation's full-context arm sends the whole Act. The original text is
# 117 676 prompt tokens of assembled articles, annexes and recitals, measured
# on 2026-09-05 rather than estimated, so the window has to clear that plus
# whatever the answer needs. 131 072 leaves 12 256 spare after a 4 096 answer.
#
# 131 072 is also the ceiling this card holds. `num_ctx` 262 144 needs roughly
# 40 GB against a 32.6 GB card, and this setting already steadies at 29.8 to
# 30.4 GB with nothing else on the card. Anything else claiming GPU memory
# mid-run pushes layers to CPU and the wall-time column stops comparing.
#
# Separate from `annex-qwen3-27b` rather than widening it. That model answers
# from a retrieval result and is sized at 32 768 for it, and every agent call
# would otherwise hold 30 GB of the card to read a few provisions.
#
# This machine's Ollama server happens to run with OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH set to
# 131072, so the baseline arm appears to work with no Modelfile at all here and
# breaks anywhere that variable is unset. That is the whole reason the setting
# is carried by this tracked file rather than left to the environment.
#
# Build with scripts/ollama-build.sh.

FROM qwen3.8:27b

PARAMETER num_ctx 131072
